      "body": "Thanks Jon — that message never reached me; your comment is the first I've seen of it, so thank you for relaying it.\n\nPoint taken on the sequencing. I've converted this to a draft and will take a short write-up of the idea to the list. For what it's worth, the idea didn't come out of nowhere — writing it up as an informational BIP was Jameson Lopp's suggestion after he read the paper, and Murch saw an early draft in May. But understood that interest gets established on the list, not in a PR.\n",
